OL,3,GNEWSARoads, buses and railways set for
OL,4,A#643m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FBus services, cycling routes and
OL,7,Frailway station upgrades are among the
OL,8,Fpriorities in a #643m transport funding
OL,9,Fpackage for Lancashire over the next
OL,10,Ffour years.
OL,12,FThe Lancashire Combined County
OL,13,FAuthority (LCCA) has approved its Local
OL,14,FTransport Delivery Plan, setting out
OL,15,Fhow government funding will be spent
OL,16,Fbetween 2026 and 2030.
OL,18,FThe biggest share of the money, #268m,
OL,19,Fwill go towards road maintenance and
OL,20,Fimprovements.
